&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AKA:&lt;/strong&gt; A Multiversal &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;Joy&lt;/span&gt;ride&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe | Euclid | Keter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144 is &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; 5 separate entities/objects. 5144-2 and 5144-3 have been contained but 5144-1 cannot be contained by any means in this reality (See SCP-5144-1 log for details). SCP-5144-4 is a titanic marble structure located in Iceland that is a gateway to another reality. SCP-5144-5 is an alternate reality of which connected to ours by SCP-5144-4 (See 5144-4 and 5144-5 logs for more details).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The containment cell of SCP-5144-1, 5144-2, and 5144-3, is a large aircraft hangar sized room located 30 meters underground at Site 38. The hangar is partially taken up by SCP-5144-3 due to its size. The entrance to the cell is a 10 by 6 foot sized metal door. Clustered near the entrance are some cushioned chairs and a coffee table. On the walls of the cell are paintings of other worlds and entities. Small statues are scattered around the room. A desk covered in pieces of metal is located near the sculptures, this is where SCP-5144-1 constructs them. The builds resemble miniature models of SCPs that have been used on 5144-1 in termination attempts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum| First Contact:&lt;/strong&gt; Upon March 17th, 20██ at 1:19 PM, SCP-179 was seen pointing toward the planet Neptune. On the far side of the planet, light distortions were visible. The light distortions continued for 2 hours before a massive explosion came from it. The explosion resembled a small supernova, which vaporized about 40% of Neptune&#039;s upper atmosphere. Out of the explosion a comet was seen on a direct collision course with Earth. Within 5 minutes, the comet had made it from Neptune to the Moon and slowed drastically. While passing by Mars, a radio transmission was picked up coming from the comet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Radio Transmission detected:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Hallo! Hallo! Ist da jemand? Dies ist [DATA LOST] der [DATA LOST] Freiheit, die um Erlaubnis zur Landung bittet! Mein Schiff ist [DATA LOST] beschädigt und ich muss Reparaturen durchführen. Ist [DATA LOST] bewohnbar?! Ich wiederhole: Ist die Erde bewohnbar?!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Radio Transmission Translation:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Hello! Hello! Is anyone there? This is the [DATA LOST] of the [DATA LOST] freedom, asking for permission to land! My ship is [DATA LOST] damaged and I need to repair it. Is [DATA LOST] habitable?! I repeat, is Earth habitable ?! &amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attempts to connect to the individual on the radio failed. The anomalous comet continued on its way to Earth, slowing gradually as it entered the atmosphere. At 3:28 the comet crashed in a field near Finley, Tennessee.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A large meteorite is found by researchers sitting in a 10 feet deep crater with the diameter being around 70 meters. The nearby oak forest had been scorched by the crash as well as an abandoned farmhouse. No one seemingly was injured during the crash. The Foundation quickly set up a perimeter around the crater and kept any news media from getting near the meteorite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;March 20th, 20██ at 6:57 PM, 3 days after the meteorite crashed. The meteorite began shaking for 30 seconds before it &amp;quot;turned into water&amp;quot; says one of the researchers who tested the liquid to make sure. Inside the crater now lay a mysterious metal machine surrounded by a puddle of water. Scientists attempted to get samples of the machine but failed, no tools or weapons the Foundation had on site could damage the construct.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;March 21st, 20██ at 12:34 PM, loud banging could be heard from inside the machine. D-class personnel was sent in to investigate the noises. The D-class claims to hear voices, yelling, inside the machine. Foundation agents told the D-class to try to make contact with the voice, of which the D-class did. The voice instructed them to locate a cargo bay door and remove and blockages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The D-class followed the voice to the back of the machine and was instructed by the voice to remove the dirt blocking a large cargo bay door. An armed guard brought the D-class a shovel and they proceeded to remove the dirt. After it was cleared, a loud banging came from inside the cargo bay. 2 minutes of banging went on before the cargo bay door blasted open, heaving the entire machine a few feet in the air. Out of the machine came 2 figures; human male in a tuxedo and a large, dark blue creature (SCP-5144-1 and SCP-5144-2.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/750525450379460610/778444314212171796/wolf_thinggy_idrk_1_half_hours_hhhhhhhhhhhhh.png&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot; alt=&quot;wolf_thinggy_idrk_1_half_hours_hhhhhhhhhhhhh.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-1 digital artwork by Researcher Arthur Johnson&lt;/p&gt;
