&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AKA:&lt;/strong&gt; Mozart&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;Euclid&lt;/span&gt; Keter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 cannot be contained by the Foundation but the lifeform does stay inside 5144&#039;s containment cell at Site 38 by choice. The 5144-1 can&#039;t be contained because of one of its anomalous abilities (Seen below).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 is a bipedal reptilian lifeform. Approximately 2.5 meters in height and weighs over 200kg. The flesh of the entity is a dark grey and the skin is covered by millions of small, dark blue scales. 5144-1 has a large head, in the shape of a snake head, with a pair of eyes on each side of the skull. Nostrils are located above the front lip. Entity has 4 fangs located inside its maw, 2 inches long each, that secrete the MF-1 substance in extremely concentrated amounts. The eyes glow light blue. The creature can communicate verbally despite a lack of vocal cords or tongue. The chest cavity of the creature is visible with a glowing blue orb floating inside it. The orb does not show up on any scanners however the hume level does. Inside the chest cavity of 5144-1, the hume level rapidly increases and decreases at an unsteady rate, however not affecting the hume level outside the chest cavity. If 5144-1 consumes any item, when the item enters the chest cavity, it is absorbed by the orb.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The lifeform&#039;s skeletal structure is constructed entirely of an unknown metal. Attempts to study the metal have failed due to 5144-1&#039;s anomalous ability. Whatever the bones are made of seems to have the same density as steel. The creature has only 3 digits on its hands/feet. Upon 5144-1&#039;s back are 4 hatches, each 4 inches in diameter, that open to extend long robotic limbs of the same metal the skeleton is constructed from. The limbs can extend up to 2 meters in length and each have a robotic hand on them. The robotic hands have 4 digits each. The robotic limbs can retract back into the body of 5144-1 however there is no visible changes to the chest cavity of the entity. SCP-5144-1 has a large serpentine tail stretching 2.5 meters in length with large plates made of the same skeletal alloy fused to the top.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adorned on the tip of the tail is a small flower similar to a water lily, however glowing a pink hue. Inside the center of the flower is a cluster of powder known as MF-1 substance. The substance causes sedation if inhaled or consumed. When burned, MF-1 becomes an extremely powerful hallucinogen and sense dampener. SCP-5144-1 seems to be immune to the sedative ability but is still susceptible to the hallucinogen. SCP-5144-1 has its spine protected by smaller plates similar to the ones on its tail. Entity has no digestive organs. The respiratory system of the entity pumps a dark blue blood through the body of unknown means, as no lungs or heart are existent within 5144-1. SCP-5144-1 prefers to be identified as &amp;quot;Mozart&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-1&#039;s origins are unknown. SCP-5144-1&#039;s knowledge of its existence is limited.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behavior:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 is a rather benevolent lifeform. It is quite open to the Foundation of its existence however will not talk about a specific time in its past around 10 thousand years before contact. 5144-1 also seems to feel happy by making others feel happy, including trying to cheer up one guard who lost a friend in a containment breach at another site. The SCP seems to want to help the Foundation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-1 prefers creating things. It will generally will construct canvases then paint detailed images of places it&#039;s been to and lifeforms it&#039;s seen. It will then try to show staff the paintings and explain the worlds they are of. But when questioned about a painting of a pink reptilian humanoid, 5144-1 refuses to talk. The creature also seems to enjoy constructing metal sculptures of other SCPs, weapons of alien construct, and otherworldly furniture. SCP-5144-1 donates its alien weapons to the researchers to study and possibly distribute to MTF units.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-1 has no sexual attraction to humans. However, it has shown interest in SCP-1472, claiming that Dr. Bright said something about Velociraptors in maid costumes. SCP-5144-1 has sent 4 requests to Dr. Paul Blart for permission to enter SCP-1472, permission has been denied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anomalous Properties:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 has proven not to be able to die. The central orb cannot be damaged by any known methods. The body of 5144-1 is durable but still destroyable. However when removed from the majority of the body or destroyed, the limbs or remaining body will disintegrate only to reconstruct around the central orb. If any portions are still missing after reconstruction, the nearest object will begin to disintegrate and reconstruct the missing body portions until the body is complete, then cease disintegration of nearest object.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-1 can launch concentrated heat from the palms of its robotic limbs. The beams of heat exceed over 2000 degrees Celsius but the heat stays confined to the 4 inch diameter of the robotic limbs. When activated, four beams of blue light protrude from the central core of 5144-1 and proceed to move through the flesh to connect where the robotic limbs enter the body. It is suggested that the energy is drawn from the central orb, but this theory is not fully proven.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-1 seems to have atom altering abilities. 5144-1 can manipulate the atomic makeup of any item and change it into something else. The manipulation seems to take a great amount of energy from 5144-1. The more complex something is, the harder it is for 5144-1 to change it. A simple glass cup is easier to alter than a motherboard of a computer. When exerting too much energy, 5144-1 will cease life functions, resulting in it falling to the ground, for approximately 25 to 30 seconds before restarting. 5144-1 afterwards will remain unconscious until it has regained its strength.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-1 can open portals to other universes/realities. It does this by firing 4 separate heat beams at a single point. When all four beams connect, it opens a portal that gets larger the longer 5144-1 continues its bombardment. The portals close shortly after being opened. The entity seems not to be able to control the reality that a portal is opened to, however this is possibly not true (See 5144-1 containment breach).&lt;/p&gt;
