&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-1 Breach&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Breach cause:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Breach&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;On August 26th, 20██ at 7:28 PM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distress call:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Emergency! This is Dr. Paul Blart. SCP-5144-1 just broke containment! I repeat, 5144-1 has broken containment! Site 38 requesting assistance!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ok. Dispatching MTF unit Omega-7 to your location. The MTF unit will be there momentarily.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;8:23 PM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Commander:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;We have reached Site 38, no fatalities. SCP-5144-1 seems to have broken through the roof of its containment cell. SCP-5144-1 is currently sprinting at 60 miles per hour to an unknown location. We are in pursuit in helicopters with Dr. Paul Blart. SCP-5144-1 is also currently enveloped in a dark red flame!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Continue your pursuit! You have full authorization to attempt to slow 5144-1&#039;s movement. Terminate it if you need to.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Commander:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Affirmative. *off mic* Omega-7, begin firing upon SCP-5144-1!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;8:44&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Commander:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command, SCP-5144-1 is not slowing its speed. We can&#039;t do enough damage up here!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Understood. Attempt to deploy units in 5144-1&#039;s path!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Commander:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Yes command. *off mic* Deploy MTF in helicopters 2, 3 and 5 in SCP-5144-1&#039;s path!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;8:47&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Commander:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command! We have casualties!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What happened?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**Omega-7 Commander: &amp;quot;SCP-5144-1 disintegrated helicopters 2, 3 and 5, along with all MTF inside them! Its pace has not slowed. SCP-5144-1 also fired an energy beam and took down helicopter 4, no casualties in 4.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Continue pursuit at safe distance!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; *off mic* &amp;quot;Give me that!&amp;quot; *on mic* &amp;quot;MTF Command, is there anything in the direction it&#039;s currently heading?!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Site-██ is in its current direction. You are about 120 miles from it.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Inform all staff at that site to evacuate! SCP-5144-1 is going to barrel right through it like it did the helicopters!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;We will.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;10:45&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Commander:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;SCP-5144-1 is nearing Site-██ and starting to slow!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Evacuation is in progress. How long until it gets there?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Commander:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;SCP-5144-1 has stopped! It is currently standing outside the site gate. Wait no, it just disintegrated the gate! I repeat, 5144-1 just disintegrated the gate. It is entering the site.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Remain safe distance. We will warn personnel inside.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;10:51&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;We are monitoring the site camera system. SCP-5144-1 has entered researcher Takenaka&#039;s office. Takenaka is currently trapped inside with it. SCP-5144-1 is standing across the desk from Takenaka.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;10:53&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;SCP-5144-1 just threw Takenaka into the wall and has taken SCP-1762! It is leaving the room.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;11:01&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Commander:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command! We have visual on SCP-5144-1! It has exited the site and is carrying SCP-1762 with a robotic limb coiled around it. The fire encasing 5144-1 is not damaging 1762. Do we engage?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Negative. Remain safe distance but continue pursuing 5144-1.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Commander:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Yes Comman-&amp;quot; *loud explosion*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Commander? Omega-7 do you copy?!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Commander:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command, helicopter 1 has been shot down. 2 casualties. Helicopters 6, 7, and 8 will continue pursuit.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Affirmative.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Lieutenant:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command, this is helicopter 6. SCP-5144-1 has broken into a sprint approximately 80 miles per hour and rapidly increasing!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Continue pursuit.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;1:36&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Lieutenant:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command. SCP-5144-1 has just reached the Atlantic ocean but shows no sign of stopping. It is freezing the water below it while it&#039;s running!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Maintain pursuit. You cannot lose SCP-5144-1.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;3:12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Lieutenant:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command. SCP-5144-1 has just reached land. Current location is the southwestern side of Iceland. We are also running low on fuel for the helicopters.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Maintain pursuit until yo-&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Lieutenant:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;SCP-5144-1 has stopped! I repeat, 5144-1 has stopped!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Land a safe distance from SCP-5144-1.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;4:19&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;SCP-5144-1 is currently in a kneeling position in front of SCP-1762, which is a few feet from it.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Lieutenant:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Dr. Blart. Stay away from 5144-1.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What is happening?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;SCP-5144-1 just stood up!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unknown voice:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;&lt;em&gt;YOU DON&#039;T GET TO ABANDON HUMANITY!&lt;/em&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What what that!?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Lieutenant:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;SCP-5144-1 just threw SCP-1762! 1762 got 70 meters or so before 5144-1 began firing energy beams at it!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;He&amp;#8230; He&#039;s crossing the beams!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What does that mean?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;He said that crossing the beams opens-&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Lieutenant:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command! A bright light is coming from SCP-1762&#039;s locatio- *a loud explosive noise* COMMAND! A giant beam of light is shooting into the sky where 1762 was!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;We are connecting to your body cams.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;The beam&amp;#8230; its getting bigger! It just enveloped SCP-5144-1!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Get out of there!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Lieutenant:&lt;/strong&gt; *off mic* &amp;quot;Get those choppers in the air NOW!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;4:29&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Hello? Lieutenant?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;We barely made it out of there but the helicopters are practically out of fuel. Command&amp;#8230; the beam shooting in the sky is now about 2 fucking kilometers large!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; *off mic* &amp;quot;Guys look out the window&amp;#8230;&amp;quot; &amp;quot;Jesus christ!&amp;quot; *on mic* &amp;quot;We have visual on the beam of light. Where is the lieutenant?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;The lieutenant is gone. He was absorbed by the beam of light. As well as helicopter 8. The beam has stopped growing in size and I can see movement inside it.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Are you a safe distance?!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Yes.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ok. We are sending help.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;6:48&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command! There is some kind of structure inside the beam of light! I can see something in there. Something big. It just stopped! Command the beam of light is gone! Oh&amp;#8230; oh my god!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Blart? What is happening?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Holy shit! There is a titanic shape where the beam of light was! It&amp;#8230; it looks to be made out of some sort of white material.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;How big is the structure?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command. Its the fucking size of the beam! WAIT! Oh god where is 5144-1?!&amp;quot; *the mic is heard dropping to the floor*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Cadet:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;C.. Command? Dr. Blart just ran off toward the structure. What should I do?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Stay there. Help should be arriving shortly.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;7:12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Omega-7 Cadet:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command. Dr. Blart is back. He dragged SCP-5144-1 behind him. Here he is.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Command.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTF Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Blart what happened?! Why did you leave?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Paul Blart:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I went to the structure and found 5144-1 passed out on the floor. The structure is massive. Get researchers out here now! We need to know what this thing is!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Breach Secured&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviews of SCP-5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewed:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1| AKA: Mozart&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Arthur Johnson | Level 4 researcher&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; 5144-1 was questioned of its existence and reason for coming to Earth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log, March 23rd, 20██ at 5:30 PM&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Hello SCP-5144-1. I hear you like being called Mozart, is that correct?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Yes, that is correct.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ok. Now we have wanted to know, Why did you come here? To this planet I mean.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Alright big backstory time with Mozart. So a few&amp;#8230; what about 30,000 years ago? Sorry I stopped counting after 700. I just woke up I guess? I don&#039;t remember anything before then, just waking up and started existing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ok. *Arthur wrote down the date in his notebook* Now please continue.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I woke up in the void I guess? No stars, no noise, just nothingness. In my hand I clutched a tiny metal disk. After a few minutes of understanding what it felt like to move limbs, I fumbled with the disk and a little hologram turned on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A tiny figure stood on the disk. He had one eye and some funny horns, as well as a slightly uh&amp;#8230; large body. Actually I can show you the hologram. *SCP-5144-1 placed the disk on the table and turned it on*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(See Hologram Message)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I was so confused after watching that but after a few months floating in space with the ability to not die, I learned how to harness my abilities. Somehow I knew already how to speak and how to use my abilities. I gotta say though, it was a weird experience. Anyways, I learned how to open portals and entered a new universe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; *Arthur was staring at 5144-1 before snapping out of it* &amp;quot;Wow&amp;#8230; that must have been a very odd experience. How did you specifically get to our universe though?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Oh right! Me and Amidias are on a conquest across the cosmos. Like a multiversal joyride. We uh&amp;#8230; ran into some trouble. I was kinda was in the middle of a military space battle. Bullets and missiles flying everywhere. I just got stuck in the middle of it when it started and had to open a rift to get out of there. However, my ship was hit by a rogue missile and that&#039;s why it looked like a ball of fire coming down here.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Jeez, that is something else. Why was there fighting?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Some alien lifeforms having a weird dispute over space and territory I think.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Wow. Thanks Mozart, this has been quite an enlightening interview.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;No problem dude. See ya later.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log, March 23rd, 20██ at 5:40 PM&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 is an interdimensional traveler that does not know how it even exists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewed:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1| AKA: Mozart&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Linda Brooke | Level 3 Researcher&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 was interviewed before a test of its atom restructuring abilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log, April 2nd, 20██ at 10:45 AM&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linda:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Hello SCP-5144-1, my name is Linda. We have some questions for you then we want to test your anomalous abilities. Is that ok?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Sure doc, ask away.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linda:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;We have some questions about SCP-5144-3, your ship. What is it constructed of?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Er&amp;#8230; Don&#039;t remember. I bought it from some guy in the Messier 82 galaxy.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linda:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Interesting. *Linda writes on her notepad* Ok now there were some odd items inside your ship. Starting with the cargo bay, what was in there?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Oh yea! The fruit crates in there I picked up on an uncharted planet a few lightyears from where Earth should have been. I didn&#039;t check though. There should have also been my fancy knife somewhere in there&amp;#8230; I think that&#039;s everything in the cargo bay.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linda:&lt;/strong&gt; *Finishes writing notes down* &amp;quot;Ok now there were also some lockers in the top level of 5144-3 containing many different items. Can you explain what they are and why you have some of them?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;There&#039;s some canned meat and water in there. &amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Lets see, there&#039;s the laser rifle I got in there&amp;#8230; &lt;em&gt;Oh God not the grenades!&lt;/em&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linda:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Calm down. 5144-2 left you a note in the locker to remind you what they were. We did not touch them.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 sat back down in his seat*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Phew. Ok I think the last thing is a mirror? I don&#039;t remember where I got it.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linda:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Wait, we found something else in one of the lockers. A photo album with pictures you and another lifeform waving at the camera. Can you tell us what this is?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I&amp;#8230;I really rather not talk about it&amp;#8230;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*a tear drips down 5144-1&#039;s cheek.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linda:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ok, I see it is a hard topic for you. Let&#039;s move onto the experiment. Please follow me.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Linda led SCP-5144-1 into an empty room with a coffee table and a pile of dirt on it.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linda:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Alright. We want to test your atom altering abilities. Can you please turn the pile of dirt into anything that comes to mind.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;&lt;em&gt;Anything?&lt;/em&gt; Ok then, I got an idea.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Linda proceeded to back away as 5144-1&#039;s mechanical arms and palms started to glow. Then 5144-1 raised his right hand to aim at the pile of dirt and the dirt started to float slowly, particle by particle, into the air. 5144-1 then blasted the floating dirt with 1 beam of light from its arm, completely obliterating the floating mass.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5144-1 then proceeded to raise all 4 mechanical arms on its back to face the same way his arm was aimed. Then the palm of his hand as well as the centers of the 4 robotic arms started emitting blue waves of light visible in the air. The waves crossed the room toward the area where the pile of dirt had been floating. Quickly the air around the location of where the dirt was started to distort as a tiny construct was becoming visible. The atoms had been in the air around the room and now were rejoining into something else. 2 minutes went by before 5144-1 was complete.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After 5144-1 stopped emitting blue light waves, a gold microwave lay atop the coffee table. 5144-1 immediately passed out on the floor after the microwave was complete. The process seems to take an immense amount of energy from 5144-1.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linda:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Get a stroller, move him back to his containment cell and&amp;#8230;. Uh, move the microwave there too.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log, April 2nd, 20██ at 11:02 AM&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 can manipulate atoms of any item but requires a great amount of energy. &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;A golden microwave is currently the most complex item it has created while in foundation custody.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewed:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1| AKA: Mozart&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Arthur Johnson | Level 4 Researcher&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; After waking from his comatose state, 5144-1 was interviewed about the incident.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log, October 30th, 20██ at 4:33 PM&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Hello Mozart. How are you feeling?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ugh&amp;#8230; I feel kind of drained. What happened?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Actually, we were hoping you would know. Why did you breach containment?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What!? Um, I don&#039;t know what you&#039;re talking about.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;You disintegrated the ceiling and ran off toward Site ██, then took an item from there and made your way to-&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Wait what? Dude, I was here.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Look up.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 looked to the roof and saw the 6 meter wide hole it made.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Oh dear. This isn&#039;t some joke. But wait, how did I do that? I should have dropped right outside the hole from the energy use&amp;#8230;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Yes we thought the same thing but you surprised us all.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Oh no! I didn&#039;t hurt anybody did I?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;You disintegrated an entire MTF squad&amp;#8230;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Oh god.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Mozart, what do you remember.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I was sitting on the couch reading some SCP articles on an iPad. Wait, there was something else. Right before I&amp;#8230;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;We looked at the iPad after we got you back here. You were reading an article about SCP-1762.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What one was that? Some sort of bo- Box, a box&amp;#8230; why does that seem so familiar.&amp;quot; *5144-1 got up and started pacing around before gasping loudly* &amp;quot;&lt;em&gt;I remember!&lt;/em&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;You remember what?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;The box, the box of dragons. It&amp;#8230; it&#039;s coming back to me. The article made me feel s&amp;#8230; sad? Yea, I kinda wished I could have done something. But what?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Do you have memory problems frequently?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;No very rarely&amp;#8230; A weird dream&amp;#8230; &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; does something not seem righ-&amp;quot; *5144-1 stopped abruptly and then muttered something unintelligible* &amp;quot;I&amp;#8230; I&#039;m sorry Arthur I need to go.&amp;quot; *5144-1 then ran toward 5144-3 and boarded it, closing the cargo bay behind it.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arthur:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Mozart wait! We are in the middle of an interview.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log, October 30th, 20██ at 4:37 PM&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; Some data about the breach was uncovered but not enough to find out why 5144-1 breached containment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Hologram&amp;nbsp;Recording&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Hologram&amp;nbsp;Recording&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following message was translated by SCP-5144-1.&lt;br /&gt;
The message is in an unknown language.&lt;br /&gt;
The metal disk that dispenses the hologram message has great wear and barely functions.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Beginning Message Translation&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unknown Figure:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s been a long time Brother.&lt;br /&gt;
I am sad you had to destroy yourself for those pitiful lifeforms below you. But you always were so fascinated by them. &lt;em&gt;*a chuckle*&lt;/em&gt; You were always the one to look on the bright side of this painful existence. I remember when you turned the star ways I tore apart into beautiful tapestries of chaos. I do miss seeing them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*a pause*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That world&amp;#8230; You put so much time and love into that world. But why did you have to go destroy yourself for it? Was it worth it? All that pain?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*another pause*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My children have failed me. You are my last hope.&lt;br /&gt;
I am imprisoned below the sand, and the child of light stands in the way of my freedom. If you are going to free me, you must destroy the child of light.&lt;br /&gt;
Free me, Brother.&lt;br /&gt;
So that I may destroy this painful existence, and you can create it a new from the ashes.&lt;br /&gt;
Free me, Brother.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Message Translation&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
