&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Tests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;These are the logs of 3 cross-tests that all shared the similar feeling of Deja Vu from SCP-5144-1. No connection with the SCPs used for testing are found as of yet.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Cross&amp;nbsp;Test&amp;nbsp;SCP-5144-1&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;SCP-3000&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Cross&amp;nbsp;Test&amp;nbsp;SCP-5144-1&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;SCP-3000&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Test:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Test:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-3000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; To test 5144-1&#039;s immunity to cognitohazards, it was supposed to be introduced to the Y909 compound. However, 5144-1 insisted it go meet SCP-3000 face to face. The request was met with hesitation from head researchers but was accepted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Test&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*SCP-5144-1 exits the SCPF Eremita. It was given a waterproof radio it carried in one robotic hand, as well as a glass flask in its right hand. 5144-1 was instructed to expose itself to the Y909 compound and attempt to collect some of the compound in the flask.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;You are nearing SCP-3000. About 400 meters. Do you see anything?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Nope. Damn its pitch black out here. What am I looking for again?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;SCP-3000 resembles a massive serpent or eel-like lifeform.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;A big snake. Got it.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 is now 200 meters from 3000*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I gotta say, it&#039;s nice being able to float around like I&#039;m in space. No stars, just blackness&amp;#8230; *sigh* peaceful.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Please remain on task.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Yea yea I know.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 is now 120 meters from 3000*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Uhh I think I found it.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1&#039;s tail flower casts a purple light across the face of SCP-3000. 3000 has started excreting the Y909 compound.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Please swim toward the Y909 substance.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;You mean the dark liquid right&amp;#8230; Ugh! Why did I sign up for this.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 swam into the dark mass*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Do you feel anything?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Not rea- *5144-1 started gagging* Disgusting! The compound tastes like spoiled milk.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Do you remember your task?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Yep. Expose myself to some of the substance and then get a sample. I don&#039;t think I am forgetting anything.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Movement to your left! What do you see?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*SCP-3000 had moved and was now looking at 5144-1*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;A large mouth and a ton of teeth. Uh&amp;#8230; Hello ma&#039;am?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Who are you speaking to?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Who do ya think&amp;#8230; The snake. Woah that&#039;s weird.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What is?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;This feels familiar, not the place but like, her. Like some weird Deja Vu. Maybe it&#039;s the Y909 stuff.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Be careful. We don&#039;t know what will happen if you are consumed.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Yea I know. She&#039;s kinda cute. Hah, she&#039;s smiling at me.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*3000 had opened its mouth*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Mozart get out of the way!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 barely swam out of the way. 2 robotic limbs had been ripped off and consumed by 3000.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Woah there!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Retrieve the Y909 substance and return.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;On it.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 swam near the back of 3000&#039;s head and filled the flask it carried with the compound.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Aight, got the compound. Heading back to the sub.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;5144-1 incoming!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*3000 lunged at 5144-1 again, this time biting off his tail*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;&lt;em&gt;Jesus woman&lt;/em&gt;! I&#039;m like the first guy you&#039;ve ever met who hasn&#039;t been scared to death by your face and you&#039;re already trying to kill me. No wonder you don&#039;t have a man!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*snickers are heard from Command&#039;s side of the radio*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Get back here quick.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Right.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 returned to the Eremita&#039;s exit hatch and entered. It gave the vial to command and the Eremita resurfaced.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Test&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-3000&#039;s Y909 substance does not affect SCP-5144-1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Cross&amp;nbsp;Test&amp;nbsp;SCP-5144-1&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;SCP-682&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Cross&amp;nbsp;Test&amp;nbsp;SCP-5144-1&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;SCP-682&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Test:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Test:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-682&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; To test both SCP-5144-1 and SCP-682&#039;s immortality, they were put in a cell with instructions to terminate each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Test&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*SCP-5144-1 enters the cell. SCP-682 is visible on the side of the room opposite to 5144-1.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Hello SCP uh&amp;#8230; 682. I am 5144-1, you can call me Mozart if you want.&amp;quot; *5144-1 holds out hand as if to shake 682&#039;s hand*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;682:&lt;/strong&gt; *Coming closer to 5144-1* &amp;quot;You are an interesting creature, so I will not kill you yet.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Thanks? I guess&amp;#8230;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;682:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What are you?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Huh. What?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;682:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I said, What are you?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Oh. Hah, I don&#039;t even know. Am I a plant or animal? The day I find out, heh&amp;#8230; that&#039;ll be the day.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;682:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;You feel&amp;#8230; familiar somehow. I never have met you but you still seem familiar.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Hmmm. You are right, I got the same feeling I got with the slime creature. Interesting&amp;#8230;&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*SCP-682&#039;s eyes widen*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;682:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;How did you come into creation?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I beg your pardon?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;682:&lt;/strong&gt; *seeming slightly stressed* &amp;quot;&lt;em&gt;How&lt;/em&gt; did you come into creation?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I don&#039;t know. Kinda just woke up in the middle of the void. Why do you as-&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 is cut off by the sound of the intercom*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ok SCP-5144-1, please let SCP-682 attempt to terminate you.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Got it doc. *turning to 682* C&#039;mon hit me with your best shot!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*SCP-682 attacked 5144-1. 5144-1 did not defend itself in any way. After 3 and a half minutes of 682 tearing apart 5144-1&#039;s body, 682 stopped.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;5144-1 you still alive?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; *Now a severed head in the corner* &amp;quot;Yea doc I&#039;m good.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 took 2 minutes and 53 seconds to reform.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ok now, SCP-5144-1, please terminate SCP-682.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;682:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ugh. Don&#039;t bother, he knows you can&#039;t kill me.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;If that&#039;s true, then I&#039;m sorry this is gonna hurt like hell.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 raised its robotic arms and began firing its energy beams. Loud screams can be heard from 682. This went on for a continual 4 minutes of bombardment before 5144-1 ceased attack. 682 was only a charred corpse now.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; *sniffing the air* &amp;quot;Oh no, looks like I overcooked dinner.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;682:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I.. I&#039;ll kill you for that!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*682 lunged at 5144-1&#039;s leg and attempted to rip it off. However, 5144-1 leaped out of the way and then constrained 682 with its robotic arms.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Dude. You couldn&#039;t kill me in your full state, you ain&#039;t getting anything done looking like that. I guess I can try to help.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 raised its right hand to face 682. Then it started to glow blue-ish and 682&#039;s body reformed at a rate drastically quicker than normal. Finishing in only 30 seconds.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Is that better?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;682:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What the? How did you do that?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;One of my *holding up fingers to form quotation symbols* anomalous abilities. Not as cool as being able to bend reality but still is fun.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 seems to have the same anomalous regeneration SCP-682 does. However, 5144-1&#039;s regeneration is exponentially quicker than 682&#039;s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Interaction&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;SCP-5144-1&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;SCP-999&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Interaction&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;SCP-5144-1&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;SCP-999&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-1 requested to meet with SCP-999. Video footage was taken of the interaction as normal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Recording&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*SCP-5144-1 enters SCP-999&#039;s containment. No staff are present in the room. SCP-999 notices 5144-1 and squirms over to it.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Hello little guy.&amp;quot; *5144-1 bent down to meet 999*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;999:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Little squeaking noises&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher watching interaction:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Odd. It has never had a reaction like this to anyone.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Huh, I do feel better. But why do I feel like I know this guy from somewhere?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What do you mean?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I know for a fact I haven&#039;t met him before but he somehow seems familiar. I can&#039;t explain it. Like, something about him feels very familiar but I don&#039;t know why. It&#039;s like that feeling I had with 3k.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;3k?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;3000. The big serpent lady who makes the amnestics.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*999 starts playing with 5144-1&#039;s tail flower, then falls back and sneezes because of the psychedelic pollen. The pollen has no effect on 999.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Heh, what a funny creature you are.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*SCP-5144-1 continued to interact with 999, forming pieces of candy from the air and giving it to 999, for 10 minutes before leaving.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Recording&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Other&amp;nbsp;Cross&amp;nbsp;Tests&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Other&amp;nbsp;Cross&amp;nbsp;Tests&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum| Cross test SCP-173:&lt;/strong&gt; Cross testing of SCP-5144-1 with SCP-173 to attempt to kill 5144-1 was attempted. SCP-5144-1 willingly entered the containment cell of 173 and let its neck get snapped. The test failed as 5144-1 remained alive. It was instructed to terminate the 173 clone on the spot and succeeded in vaporizing 80% of 173. This is the reason for the tremors felt throughout the site on the same day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum| Cross test SCP-4162:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 was deployed in close proximity to SCP-4162 after 4162 killed a D-class. SCP-4162 designated 5144-1 as its target and began approaching it. When SCP-5144-1 was in range of 4162, its skull suddenly exploded. 10 seconds later, SCP-5144-1&#039;s skull reformed. SCP-4162 did not designate it as its target again and moved toward a D-class.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum| Cross test SCP-2200-1:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 was placed in SCP-2200-2&#039;s containment cell. SCP-2200-2 was instructed to attempt to terminate SCP-5144-1. After a few seconds of 2200-2 bickering, it agreed. SCP-5144-1 had its head removed by SCP-2200-1. 5144-1&#039;s head dematerialized and reformed back on its body. SCP-2200-2 was angered and attempted termination of 5144-1 three more times, all failed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum| Cross test SCP-3660:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 was exposed to SCP-3660 on its forearm. Upon contact with epidermis, SCP-5144-1 claimed to feel a small itch. SCP-3660 soon opened the skin of SCP-5144-1 and then detached. An opening about 5 meters in size had formed on the forearm. SCP-5144-1 reported feeling a stinging pain before it started bleeding from the opening. No entities exited 5144-1&#039;s body during this time. SCP-5144-1 continued to bleed for 2 minutes before the opening suddenly closed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum| Cross test SCP-409:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-1 was exposed to SCP-409. Upon contact with 409, 5144-1 reported a slight burning pain in its body. SCP-409 crystals began forming on its arm. 5 minutes into the test, SCP-5144-1&#039;s body is covered by crystals and suddenly shatters. The crystals then begin turning to dust, and SCP-5144-1 reformed from the dust particles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/750525450379460610/774510926774403085/unknown.png&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot; alt=&quot;unknown.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Photograph of SCP-5144-2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AKA:&lt;/strong&gt; Amidias&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-2 resides in the containment cell of SCP-5144. It is requested to stay by SCP-5144-1 but will leave if its life or another&#039;s is in danger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-2 is a humanoid synthetic construct controlled by an AI. 5144-2 is about 5 feet 11 inches in height and weighs about 85kg due to its robotic buildup. The AI controls the construct as its physical body. The AI and the construct were both made by SCP-5144-1. 5144-2 can wirelessly connect to any technology within 25 meters of it, however it is loyal to 5144-1 and will cease control of technology if 5144-1 wishes it. The AI seems to have human emotions, whether made by 5144-1 or acquired on its own is unknown.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The body resembles a white male of British descent. A mustache is visible on the face of 5144-2. 5144-2 frequently is seen wearing a fedora. It wears a tuxedo that is fused to the body of it. Attempting removal of the suit leads to the mechanical exoskeleton inside it being exposed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behavior:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-2 spends most time either conversing with 5144-1 or site personnel. When not doing that, 5144-2 is connected to the internet and learning information about this reality&#039;s earth. 5144-2 claims that it has never seen earth habited before, either a barren rock or completely gone. SCP-5144-2 can survive memetic kill agents and therefor can access level 05 files in the Foundation&#039;s database. SCP-5144-1 has requested 5144-2 to not do this however, of which it has obeyed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anomalous Properties:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-2 can wirelessly connect and control any electrical devices within 25 meters of it. This includes cars, phones, computers, neural implants, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-2 is powered by unknown means and requires no consumption of materials or energy intake.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum| Containment Breach 1:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-2 breached containment June 27th, 20██ at 10:36 AM. It connected itself to one of the computer terminals in Site 38 and was taking in data on the Foundation, completely encrypting 05 access in milliseconds. No vital information was accessed by 5144-2. The containment breach lasted only 7 minutes before 5144-1 pulled 5144-2 away from the monitor. 5144-2 was then sent to intense therapy for 3 weeks, claiming to see in the terminal. SCP-5144-2 had apparently accessed files on SCP-1471 and located files and artwork created by those affected by 1471-A.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviews of SCP-5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewed:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-2| AKA: Amidias&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. Paul Blart | Level 4 Researcher&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; After first contact was made, both SCP-5144-1 and 5144-2 were interviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log, March 23rd, 20██ at 5:45 PM&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Hello SCP-5144-2. I hear you like to be called &amp;quot;Amidias.&amp;quot; Would you like me to call you that?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I do not care whether you call me by how my creator identifies me or not.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ok. Now, why did you come to Earth?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;You mean this earth correct?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Yes.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Our ship was damaged and we only knew the closest planet with lifeforms was your planet.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Our?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Mozart&#039;s and mine.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ok. How did you come into existence?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I don&#039;t fully know. Mozart tells me that one day he just got tired of not having anyone to talk to, so he decided to construct me.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Interesting. I&#039;m guessing you are an advanced AI correct?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;That is correct.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Going back to the first question, how did your ship get damaged?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;One of the thrusters was hit by a &amp;quot;Markus III&amp;quot; thermonuclear warhead.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;It is a kind of weapon that humans had created in that universe.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What year was it in that universe?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I cannot recall ever looking for that information. Sorry.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;It is ok.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;May I ask. What are you people doing?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I beg your pardon?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I mean the SCP Foundation. The logo on your labcoat. What is the organization doing?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;I am not at liberty to give that information.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Ok then I&#039;ll find out myself.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*SCP-5144-2&#039;s eyes started glowing green as it stared at the nearest computer terminal. Breaches in the Foundation&#039;s database firewall were detected and 5144-2 had begun accessing files. SCP-5144-2 seemed interested in database entries on many SCPs, including ones requiring level 05 access. SCP-5144-1 was called into the room to persuade 5144-2 to cease, before grabbing 5144-2 and jerking its head away from the direction of the monitor.*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;What the hell are you doing Amidias?!&amp;quot; *5144-1 holding 5144-2 by the neck with a robotic arm*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-2 was visibly shaking*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Dude are you ok?&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;These people are &lt;em&gt;Insane&lt;/em&gt;!!!! So much&amp;#8230;. the cursed things these creatures create.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*5144-1 gave 5144-2 a quick shake*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-1:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Start making sense ya idiot.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5144-2:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;quot;Don&#039;t read the 1471 log! Some things are not meant to exi&amp;#8230; That thing those humans created&amp;#8230; The artwork&amp;#8230; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Help&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;!&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log, March 23rd, 20██ at 6:10 PM&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-2 had not breached any files requiring access of 05 council. 5144-2 underwent therapy for the next 3 months. It apparently had accessed the SCP-1471 logs and seen the artwork those affected by 1471-A had created. During this time, 5144-2 harassed 2 onsite guards and begged them to terminate it, which was denied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
