&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AKA:&lt;/strong&gt; The Archway&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-4 is to be contained inside a perimeter fence approximately 2.3 kilometers from the structure and surrounding it completely. Guards are to patrol the perimeter fence at all times to stop any unauthorized entrance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-4 is a large marble structure of circular shape and 2 kilometers in diameter with a height of 3 kilometers. 5144-4 was created by a containment breach of SCP-5144-1 when 5144-1 formed it using the surrounding landscape(See 5144-1 containment breach and abilities).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-4&#039;s exterior is a marble structure with no viewpoints inside. On the western side of the structure is the entrance, a 90 meter high by 40 meter wide archway. Above the archway etched in the marble reads &amp;quot;████ ██ ███████.&amp;quot; The interior of the structure is lit by floating lanterns visible around the structure at varying heights. The walls have engravings of unknown lifeforms and locations on them. Water is also seen seeping from holes in the walls to create pools. Roof of the structure has clouds that form randomly by unknown means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Between the center of the structure and the entrance is a pedestal with SCP-1762 located atop. 1762 is openable but all attempts to remove it have failed. In the direct center of SCP-5144-4 is an identical archway to the entrance. When a living creature is within 36 meters of it, the archway will start to shimmer and generate light. If a living creature passes through the archway, they are teleported to an identical structure but without water flowing from the walls or lanterns lighting it. Where the entrance should be located is instead a solid wall of sandstone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anomalous Properties:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5144-4 is a gateway to another reality (SCP-5144-5).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-4 will not let SCP-1762 be removed from the pedestal inside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-4 does not allow radio contact between different sides of the portal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
