&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/750525450379460610/777257660340109352/Screenshot_2020-11-14_124151.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot; alt=&quot;Screenshot_2020-11-14_124151.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5144-5 viewed from top of rock formation&lt;/p&gt;
