ent-2814-gamma">Document-2814-Gamma</a></td> <td>Specialized to engage electromagnetic/thermal entities.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Alpha-92</td> <td>Sare Gaav</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4797">SCP-4797</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force, specialised in long-term, independent exploration and archeological missions.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Alpha-98</td> <td>Focus Testers</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/wonder-world-dossier">Wonder World Dossier</a></td> <td>Task force assigned to Wonder World.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Alpha-99</td> <td>Fridge Raiders</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4056">SCP-4056</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• ATF-Alpha-b</td> <td>Herodotus' Chorus</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4900">SCP-4900</a></td> <td>An Applied Task Force made up of D-Class who can read Indus Script housed in O5 Compound Harappa to translate and operate with <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4900">SCP-4900</a>.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Alpha-Kaunan</td> <td>Argent Devotees</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5947">SCP-5947</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▷&nbsp;Show&nbsp;list&nbsp;for&nbsp;'Beta'</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">◁&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;list</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td>• MTF-Beta-1</td> <td>Cauterizers</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2002">SCP-2002</a></td> <td>Highly classified task force specializing in dealing with suspected cases of enemy infiltration within Foundation personnel and possible information leaks to other Groups of Interest.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• MTF-Beta-2</td> <td>Glass Houses</td>