ms relating to the SCP-2047-1 event, and containing any spacetime anomalies resulting from event 2047-1.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Omega-5</td> <td>The Jewellers</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-236-fr">SCP-236-FR</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-281-fr">SCP-281-FR</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3859">SCP-3859</a></td> <td>Unit for rapid response to anti-theistic terrorism and the containment of credohazards.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Omega-5</td> <td>The Good Boys</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5936">SCP-5936</a></td> <td>SCP-Specific Mobile Task Force focused on exploring spatial anomalies.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Omega-6</td> <td>Bearly Enough</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5464">SCP-5464</a></td> <td>SCP-Specific Mobile Task Force whose sole purpose is to monitor the actions of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5464">SCP-5464</a> and deal with individuals potentially interfering with such.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces#omega-7">MTF-Omega-7</a></td> <td>Pandora's Box</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/incident-zero-part-2">Incident Zero - Part 2</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/in-harm-s-way">In Harm's Way</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/incident-zero-part-1">Incident Zero - Part 1</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/i-thought-you-died-alone">I Thought You Died Alone</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/but-some-time-we-cant-erase">All This Wandering</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/deals-with-the-devil">Deals with the Devil</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/saturday-night-scp-showdown">Saturday Night SCP Showdown</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-076-2">Mobile Task Force Omega 7 Incident Log</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-076-2-splash">CLASSIFIED - EYES ONLY</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-657">SCP-657</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-354">SCP-354</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/agent-ukelele">Agent Ukelele</a>, 