Thinking about checking out our podcast but want to know more about SCP, Monster of The Week, the characters, and/or our cast before you do? Then give this introductory episode a listen! If you feel like you already know enough then go listen to episode 1! We thought this episode would be a nice way to introduce ourselves and answer any questions you may have about the podcast beforehand!&lt;/p&gt;
