&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effects During the Celesta Event:&lt;/strong&gt; Lost perception of external stimuli, increase in voice volume for all affected, vocalizations similar to Fifthist hymns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Person of Interest:&lt;/strong&gt; James Marshall &amp;quot;Jim&amp;quot; Hendrix&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transcription:&lt;/strong&gt; Greetings, my brothers and sisters from the same star. Today we welcome the &lt;em&gt;true&lt;/em&gt; stars, those outside the oppressive order of government! This is only the beginning, but sing and let the smoke in, so they won&#039;t find you. Don&#039;t walk in threes!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effects of the Celesta Event:&lt;/strong&gt; Symptoms similar to those afflicted by Oppositional Defiant Disorder for participants, greater affinity for musical pieces, greater consumption of hallucinogenic substances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notes:&lt;/strong&gt; This was the first known Celesta Event. Unlike the following Celesta Events, important event correlated with the anomaly occurred on the same night.&lt;/p&gt;
