act S. Yvonne at <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606767366" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span> or through Discord at <em>SYwaves#7903</em>.<br /> You can show your support by donating to their <a href="https://ko-fi.com/sywaves">Ko-fi</a>!</p> <p>If used, please credit and leave a link back to this artpage.</p> <p><em><span style="font-family:var(--mono-font); font-size: calc(var(--base-font-size) * 0.92);">All works here, unless otherwise specified, are released under <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0</span>.</span></em></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606767366" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span></p> 
